/**
 * Every owner-facing word the engine writes, in English (complete), German ("Sie"),
 * Spanish ("tú") and Polish ("ty"). Plain café-owner language; finance words are
 * explained where they first appear.
 *
 * Placeholders are {name}; numbers arrive already formatted for the language.
 * Messages with plural forms pick their form from the number in {n}.
 * The German, Spanish and Polish tables are typed as complete, so a missing
 * translation is a type error, not a silent English fallback.
 */
